{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-13","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：比例","englishTitle":"If a first magnitude have to a second the same ratio as a third to a fourth, and the third have to the fourth a greater ratio than a fifth has to a sixth, the first will also have to the second a greater ratio than the fifth to the sixth.","book":5,"number":13,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.13","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.13/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":13,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-13@raw-6a76e1bb9d1c2ebd","contentId":"euclid-5-13","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6a76e1bb9d1c2ebddb6799aed23af5659159149dd1adec2a61b4d3a2f6f19e7d","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-13.statement","euclid-5-13.construction.1","euclid-5-13.proof.1","euclid-5-13.proof.2","euclid-5-13.proof.3","euclid-5-13.proof.4","euclid-5-13.conclusion","euclid-5-13.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-13.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-13","revisionId":"euclid-5-13@raw-6a76e1bb9d1c2ebd","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"37e4b0c3aa04424ab3d8aca2a192ebb38f7a356b21e7a53d6cf481006300b02a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a first magnitude have to a second the same ratio as a third to a fourth, and the third have to the fourth a greater ratio than a fifth has to a sixth, the first will also have to the second a greater ratio than the fifth to the sixth."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一级与第三至第四级的比相同,而第三级与第四级的比相同,则第一级与第六级的比相同,第二级则与第5级与第5级之比相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-13.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-5-13","revisionId":"euclid-5-13@raw-6a76e1bb9d1c2ebd","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"544a524f97bd9e7fe63b046b5963be6f8c94812fbb5ea2c7cf866165dc158b7c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let a first magnitude A have to a second B the same ratio as a third C has to a fourth D, and let the third C have to the fourth D a greater ratio than a fifth E has to a sixth F; I say that the first A will also have to the second B a greater ratio than the fifth E to the sixth F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"初等A比二等B,与第三等C比四等D比四等D比五等E比五等E比六等F;我说,前等A比第五等E比六等F也比第二等B比较大的比比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-13.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-5-13","revisionId":"euclid-5-13@raw-6a76e1bb9d1c2ebd","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e4e0b1033fcff4ff860160883c289c1eed3ec146d5ab406edeade6a0f48a4628","citations":["euclid-5-def-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since there are some equimultiples of C, E, and of D, F other, chance, equimultiples, such that the multiple of C is in excess of the multiple of D, while the multiple of E is not in excess of the multiple of F, [[V. Def. 7](/principles/euclid-5-def-7)] let them be taken, and let G, H be equimultiples of C, E, and K, L other, chance, equimultiples of D, F, so that G is in excess of K, but H is not in excess of L; and, whatever multiple G is of C, let M be also that multiple of A, and, whatever multiple K is of D, let N be also that multiple of B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为C中有同倍数,E,D,其他机会有F,同倍数,因此C乘以D,E乘以F,但E不多于F,因此,G乘以C,E乘以C,E,K,L,L,C,K,G,K,H,L;G的乘数C,M也算A, K的乘数D,N也算B。 [[V. Def. 7](/principles/euclid-5-def-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-13.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-5-13","revisionId":"euclid-5-13@raw-6a76e1bb9d1c2ebd","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"782acb1eacba8df1ae856175b578f99752be488148259ed4c5a711d1b537ba94","citations":["euclid-5-def-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since, as A is to B, so is C to D, and of A, C equimultiples M, G have been taken, and of B, D other, chance, equimultiples N, K, therefore, if M is in excess of N, G is also in excess of K, if equal, equal, and if less, less. [[V. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-5-def-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,A比B等于C比D,A比M,G比A,C比A,M比D,G比B,A比A,同倍数比N,K,因此,如果M高于N,G比K,如果相等,等于或少于K；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。 [[V. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-5-def-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-13.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-5-13","revisionId":"euclid-5-13@raw-6a76e1bb9d1c2ebd","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5c35795440842c57bab8ec8c7641019f0bdd0873a6d48e8c618cd34ec6e54eef","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But G is in excess of K; therefore M is also in excess of N."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但G超过K,因此M也超过N。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-13.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-5-13","revisionId":"euclid-5-13@raw-6a76e1bb9d1c2ebd","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9db6d9115508c6c53e2c9728d440c24783a43fbcce711ae2771d1744c5ade5b4","citations":["euclid-5-def-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But H is not in excess of L; and M, H are equimultiples of A, E, and N, L other, chance, equimultiples of B, F; therefore A has to B a greater ratio than E has to F. [[V. Def. 7](/principles/euclid-5-def-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但H项不超过L项;M项为A项中的同倍数项,E项为E项,H项为N项,L项为其他机会,B项为同倍数项,F项为B项,较大的比项为F项。 [[V. Def. 7](/principles/euclid-5-def-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-13.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-5-13","revisionId":"euclid-5-13@raw-6a76e1bb9d1c2ebd","order":6,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-13.source","contentId":"euclid-5-13","revisionId":"euclid-5-13@raw-6a76e1bb9d1c2ebd","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"90a41cee2eb526e380de091c845b0f2023365b8530368c12c2e61b76d8cf3a01","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.13/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.13\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-13:euclid-5-def-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-13","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-13.proof.1","euclid-5-13.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-def-7","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.13